div(class="col-span-12 md:col-span-12 pt-5")
    h1.h1.text-left.pl-5.border-b-1.border-gray-200.pb-2
        i.fi-rr-folder-open
        span.ml-3 Documentación de la tienda
    p(class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 mb-6 pl-1") RUT, Cámara de Comercio, resoluciones u otros documentos. Solo PDF, Office y JPG. Máx. 5MB por archivo.

    ul#doc-tienda-lista(class="space-y-2 mb-6 min-h-[2rem]")
        li(class="text-xs text-slate-400 py-2 text-center") Sin documentos guardados

    div(class="relative group")
        input(
            type="file"
            multiple
            id="doc-tienda-input"
            accept=".jpg,.jpeg,.pdf,.doc,.docx,.xls,.xlsx,.ppt,.pptx"
            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-0 cursor-pointer z-10"
        )
        div(class="inputUpload")
            div(class="w-12 h-12 bg-white shadow-sm rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-2" style="color:#EC5FA3")
                i.fi-rr-file-add.text-2xl
            span(class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-600") Sube o arrastra documentos
            span(class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1") PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, JPG — máx. 5MB c/u

div(class="form-actions justify-between mt-8 pt-4 border-t-2 border-t-gh-primarySoft")
    div(class="flex gap-3 justify-center")
        a(href="javascript:void(0)" id="btnVolver2" class="btn btn-primary step-btn")
            i.fi-rr-arrow-small-left.mr-2
            | Volver a datos tributarios

        button(type="button" id="btnGuardarTienda" class="btn btn-secondary btn-guardar-salir")
            i.fi-rr-disk.mr-2
            | Guardar y Salir
